{"title":"Icebound Deckhand","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 52 Icebound that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (7.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>18</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around 120, -909</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>13</td><td>in the wilds around 8, -936</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>22</td><td>in the wilds around 2, -928</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>18</td><td>in the wilds around -130, -1018</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 294 total, 294 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop<br>×294</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Hollow Keel</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 28</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-410\">Layout</button></li><li><b>Coldshift Mine</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 8</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-480\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-645.4px,320.8px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><i style=\"left:613.3px;top:-392.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:637.9px;top:-326.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:716.3px;top:-278.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:633.8px;top:-315.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:650.4px;top:-300.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:646.3px;top:-331.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:715.1px;top:-265.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:660.6px;top:-334.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:635.9px;top:-330.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:634.6px;top:-312.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:688.9px;top:-270.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:723.3px;top:-291.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:677.9px;top:-323.5px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2, -936 <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 115, -922 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -126, -1018 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-deckhand\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Icebound: <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">Icebound Harpooner</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span